{% comment %}
  /pages/our-studio — Transparent editorial disclosure page.
  This page is SEO + E-E-A-T core: it tells both Google and human readers
  who we are, how we write, and what we don't do. Locked content per
  kinsoul-knowledge-base/08-brand-positioning.md.

  Also emits AboutPage schema + Organization references.
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign org_id = shop.url | append: '/#organization'
-%}

<article class="kinsoul-studio color-{{ section.settings.color_scheme }}" data-kinsoul-reveal-scope>
  <nav class="kinsoul-studio__breadcrumb page-width" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <ol class="kinsoul-studio__crumbs">
      <li><a href="/">Home</a></li>
      <li aria-hidden="true">›</li>
      <li aria-current="page">Our Studio</li>
    </ol>
  </nav>

  <header class="kinsoul-studio__hero page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <p class="kinsoul-studio__eyebrow">BEHIND THE JOURNAL</p>
    <h1 class="kinsoul-studio__title">The team behind Kinsoul Journal</h1>
    <hr class="kinsoul-studio__divider">
  </header>

  {%- comment -%} Section 1: Who we are {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="kinsoul-studio__section page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <span class="kinsoul-studio__section-number">01</span>
    <h2 class="kinsoul-studio__section-title">Who we are</h2>
    <div class="kinsoul-studio__section-body">
      <p>
        Kinsoul Energy was founded in <strong>2019</strong> by LU, a designer who started
        hand-making bracelets on her kitchen table in California after a 2018 trip to China
        where she found a stone on the ground. What began as a single piece grew into a
        six-piece collection. For years, the work stayed small — offline, personal, shared
        with friends and private clients.
      </p>
      <p>
        In <strong>early 2026</strong>, we launched kinsoulenergy.com so anyone could access
        what had previously been limited to word of mouth. Today a full-time team of five
        works from our small California studio. LU still designs every piece.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Section 2: How we write (E-E-A-T core) {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="kinsoul-studio__section kinsoul-studio__section--alt page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <span class="kinsoul-studio__section-number">02</span>
    <h2 class="kinsoul-studio__section-title">How we research, write, and publish</h2>
    <div class="kinsoul-studio__section-body">
      <p>
        This Journal is written by the Kinsoul Studio team. Our editorial workflow is transparent:
      </p>
      <ul class="kinsoul-studio__process-list">
        <li>
          <strong>Research:</strong> We use internal tools (keyword research, competitive analysis,
          source aggregation) to support the early research phase. We cite external sources
          whenever we reference data we didn't generate ourselves.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Writing:</strong> Drafts are produced by our team with the support of writing
          tools. Every draft is structurally reviewed and edited by a named human editor.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Editing:</strong> Articles are edited by <strong>Kevin</strong>, our Content Editor.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Verification:</strong> <strong>LU</strong> (Founder &amp; Designer) reviews every
          article for material accuracy and brand voice before publication.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Publishing:</strong> Articles ship only after the full review cycle. We publish
          monthly, not daily — we'd rather say something worth reading.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        We believe readers deserve to know how content is made. AI-assisted drafting is a
        tool, not a byline — every published piece is owned by a named human editor and
        verified by the founder of the studio.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Section 3: What we don't do {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="kinsoul-studio__section page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <span class="kinsoul-studio__section-number">03</span>
    <h2 class="kinsoul-studio__section-title">What we don't do</h2>
    <ul class="kinsoul-studio__dont-list">
      <li>We don't make pseudoscientific claims — no energy healing, no chakra balancing, no crystal cures.</li>
      <li>We don't publish unverified product advice. If it's in the Journal, we've tested it or cited it.</li>
      <li>We don't run undisclosed sponsored content or affiliate-driven reviews.</li>
      <li>We don't inflate our history. Kinsoul Energy is a new DTC brand (online since early 2026) — we'd rather be honest than pretend to be old.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  {%- comment -%} Section 4: Reach us {%- endcomment -%}
  <section class="kinsoul-studio__section kinsoul-studio__section--alt page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <span class="kinsoul-studio__section-number">04</span>
    <h2 class="kinsoul-studio__section-title">Reach us</h2>
    <div class="kinsoul-studio__contact">
      <p>
        <strong>Email:</strong>
        <a href="mailto:hello@kinsoulenergy.com">hello@kinsoulenergy.com</a>
      </p>
      <p><strong>Location:</strong> California, United States</p>
      <p><strong>Response time:</strong> Within 24 hours</p>
      <p class="kinsoul-studio__contact-note">
        Spotted an error in one of our articles? Please write to us.
        We correct and disclose changes in article footers.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="kinsoul-studio__cta page-width" data-kinsoul-reveal="up">
    <a href="/blogs/journal" class="kinsoul-studio__cta-link">Read the Journal →</a>
  </div>
</article>

{%- comment -%} AboutPage schema {%- endcomment -%}
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@graph": [
    {
      "@type": "AboutPage",
      "name": "Our Studio — The team behind Kinsoul Journal",
      "url": "{{ shop.url }}/pages/our-studio",
      "description": "Meet the Kinsoul Studio team. How we research, write, edit, and verify every article in the Kinsoul Journal. Full transparency on our editorial process.",
      "inLanguage": "en-US",
      "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "@id": "{{ shop.url }}/#website" },
      "about": { "@id": {{ org_id | json }} },
      "mentions": [
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "LU",
          "jobTitle": "Founder & Designer",
          "worksFor": { "@id": {{ org_id | json }} }
        },
        {
          "@type": "Person",
          "name": "Kevin",
          "jobTitle": "Content Editor",
          "worksFor": { "@id": {{ org_id | json }} }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Kinsoul Our Studio",
  "tag": "section",
  "class": "kinsoul-studio-section",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "color_scheme",
      "id": "color_scheme",
      "label": "Color scheme",
      "default": "scheme-1"
    }
  ],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "Kinsoul Our Studio"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
